Announcement was made that due to the President’s Day Holiday, on Monday, February 15,
2010, Finance Committee will meet at 11:00 a.m. and Public Services Committee will meet at 12:15
p.m. on Tuesday, February 16, 2010, in Council Meeting Room 122; Vouchers meeting will be held
in Council Chambers at Noon.
There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was
